; Without `--cc`: `glow` and `shine` render onto their own controllers,
; `wide` and `plain` ride in the residue alone, each with its own
; `render_cc_missing` wording — the pair because it is not one 7-bit
; controller, `plain` because nothing names one.
(build :kind mid)
; With `--cc 7`: only `plain` takes it. `wide` still does not render —
; the author named a controller, and 7 is not it.
(build :kind mid :cc 7)
